    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん本当だよ\r\n良かったな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……え、えっと……\r\nなんで……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんでってことはないだろう\r\n甜花の頑張りが評価されたんだよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そっか……\r\n……にへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ、ありがとう……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\n甜花の頑張りが実って、俺もうれしいよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……でも……この評価は……\r\nきっと、みんなのおかげ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "みんながいてくれたから……\r\n甜花も頑張れた……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nやっぱり甜花は優しいな",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あぅ……だって、本当にそうだから……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうふうに、周りの人の力があることに感謝するのも、\r\n大切なことだ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "けどな、甜花自身の頑張りの結果でもあるんだ\r\nだから、もっと自信を持ってもいいと俺は思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そうかな……\r\nそうなんだよね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "でも……なーちゃんたちに迷惑かけないためにも……\r\n甜花、もっと頑張らないと……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だから……これからも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと……その……\r\nプロデューサーさん、も……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……？\r\n……ああ、そういうことか",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ\r\nこれからもしっかり、サポートしていくよ",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\nにへへ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7015001010130,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "これからも、よろしくね……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701500101/7015001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、こちらこそよろしくな！",
